<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/employs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/employs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between an employing agent and an employed agent, for example a person or an organization, who is typically employed to undertaking specified work in exchange for payment."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/employs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "employs"@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/employs> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "This property should not be used for the other meaning of \"employ\", meaning to use something, e.g. \"He employed great skill . . .\"/"@en .
